    "title": "Kiss Marry Crucio Harry Wizard",
    "description": "Have you ever thought about kissing someone in the Magic Wizarding World or in Hogwarts? Hermione or Ginny? Harry or Draco? What about getting married? With Sirius or Lupin? Maybe Leta Lestrange? Now it is time to discover what you have in mind.\r\n\r\nLet the game show you who you really are, because, after all this time, your choices show who you really are. Are you ready to decide between Kiss, Marry and Crucio?\r\n\r\nWe made the app as simple as possible. On the main screen you can find the following options:\r\n\r\n-Start game: Go and start to decide, make your choices between Kiss, Marry and Crucio. To move the character, there are two options:\r\n-Drag and drop, letting your finger pressed for a second and drop it in the part you want\r\n-Tap on the character and it will change its color, then tap in the part you want to put it, so easy!\r\n-Ultimate game: Go one by one, one character after the other. You will not know the next one, that\u00b4s why you have to think twice what you want to do.\r\n-Only Boys: Just the male characters.\r\n-Only Girls: Just the female characters.\r\n-Choose House: To change the look & feel of the app and have the colors of your house.\r\n-Other magic apps: We are more than this app, we have more Harry Wizard Apps. Just have a look and if you like them, feel free to try them.",
